{"2802870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombies & Bullets", "steam_appid": 2802870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies &amp; Bullets</strong> is a 3D <strong>top-down action shooter</strong> game where you must help the soldiers <strong>Jacob</strong> and <strong>Erin</strong> face armies of <strong>zombies</strong> in varied levels full of challenges. Prove your <strong>skills</strong> and become the warrior of the zombie apocalypse!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can improve your <strong>skills</strong> at <strong>camps</strong> as you gain <strong>experience levels</strong>. You can also collect <strong>backpacks</strong> that grant <strong>unique skills</strong> while <strong>equipped</strong>. Adapt the soldiers to your <strong>playstyle</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/ce1fbb5f76c2836aed6322955ad8de6a.poster.avif?t=1786978661\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/ce1fbb5f76c2836aed6322955ad8de6a.webm?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/ce1fbb5f76c2836aed6322955ad8de6a.mp4?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of <strong>weapons</strong> like a shotgun, submachine gun, grenade launcher, flamethrower, electric cannon, grenades, etc. Explore the <strong>possibilities</strong> for every situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/0718ffaa610e3e273de7e402db4df195.poster.avif?t=1786978661\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/0718ffaa610e3e273de7e402db4df195.webm?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/0718ffaa610e3e273de7e402db4df195.mp4?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will come face-to-face with <strong>hordes of enemies</strong> that will corner you, forcing you to <strong>defeat them all</strong> to keep advancing. Use different <strong>strategies</strong> for different <strong>enemies</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/2a8db00b86203f7643ffb9776e577f98.poster.avif?t=1786978661\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/2a8db00b86203f7643ffb9776e577f98.webm?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/2a8db00b86203f7643ffb9776e577f98.mp4?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scenarios and Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore scenarios</strong> like the grove, abandoned mine, forest, ancient ruins, etc. Each scenario is <strong>divided</strong> into several <strong>levels</strong> with diverse <strong>challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/8bc520392183120793d888727d73be5e.poster.avif?t=1786978661\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/8bc520392183120793d888727d73be5e.webm?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/8bc520392183120793d888727d73be5e.mp4?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>bosses</strong> will make you prove your <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>reflexes</strong>, forcing you to use your entire arsenal of <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>movements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/4f01d006045ac344ae0d0ab1f52f8d84.poster.avif?t=1786978661\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/4f01d006045ac344ae0d0ab1f52f8d84.webm?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/4f01d006045ac344ae0d0ab1f52f8d84.mp4?t=1786978661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes on the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first scenario is available to play, including the first boss</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies &amp; Bullets</strong> is a 3D <strong>top-down action shooter</strong> game where you must help the soldiers <strong>Jacob</strong> and <strong>Erin</strong> face armies of <strong>zombies</strong> in varied levels full of challenges. Prove your <strong>skills</strong> and become the warrior of the zombie apocalypse!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yo